  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-594683390020682674 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/bg1v1z-zg/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=594683389953442738&sectionId=594683390020682674)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_jnW8l5X5_text","label":"gg_jnW8l5X5_text","default":"<p><strong>\"Your TSH is Perfect\" – What I Heard 13 Doctors Tell My Patient While She Gained 60 Pounds Eating 900 Calories</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPp4_CtBiX_text","label":"ggPp4_CtBiX_text","default":"By <strong>Dr. Margaret Anne</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglr5gNNPty_text","label":"gglr5gNNPty_text","default":"<p>Last Updated Mar 3.2025</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggj2kmbnq_-_text","label":"ggj2kmbnq_-_text","default":"<p><strong>As a naturopathic doctor, I've seen thousands of hypothyroid patients.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But I'll never forget Naomi.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>She came to me after 13 doctors told her \"Your TSH is perfect\" while she gained 60 pounds eating 900 calories a day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What I discovered in her labs – that every single doctor had ignored – made me angrier than I've ever been in my 15-year career.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because Naomi wasn't alone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Millions of women are being gaslit by doctors who only look at TSH while ignoring the hormone that's actually destroying their metabolism: Reverse T3.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is Naomi's story. But it's also probably yours.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And more importantly – it's about the solution I found that helped Naomi and over 30,000 other women finally start losing weight again.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8Vj81XRvT_text","label":"gg8Vj81XRvT_text","default":"<strong>The Moment I Knew Our Medical System Was Failing Women</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRW_iN68BA_text","label":"ggRW_iN68BA_text","default":"<p>When Naomi walked into my office, I could see the hopelessness in her eyes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Eyes so dead and worn out. Like she was fighting cancer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I greeted her with a warm, calming smile. Her facial expression changed – shocked. As if she'd never seen a doctor smile before.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>She sat down, hands clamped together tight. Hesitating. Then she whispered, almost shamefully: \"Hypothyroidism.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Before I could respond, she stopped me: \"Before you dismiss me, please listen to me first.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>My heart broke. How many doctors had dismissed her without listening?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>\"I'm so f*cking tired of being told I'm fine while I'm literally morphing into something else. Please. Just... help me.\"</strong></i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I pushed the tissues across my desk. \"You're not fine. I can see that. And I'm going to listen to every word.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then she let it all out:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>- Eating 900 calories daily, going hungry just to see the scale drop ONCE. It never did.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>- Exercising despite needing breather breaks just walking to the bathroom</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>- Sleeping 12 hours and still bedridden</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>- Spent $2,000 on supplements that did nothing</i></p><p><i>Programs that called her a liar</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>\"They think I'm sneaking McDonald's? I weigh my LETTUCE. I track every bite. I'm going insane.\"</strong></i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I had to keep my professional composure, but inside I was FURIOUS.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwBnSIoNIg_text","label":"ggwBnSIoNIg_text","default":"<strong>The Lab Results That Made Me Screenshot Everything for Evidence</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXcjld3Nx__text","label":"ggXcjld3Nx__text","default":"<p>I looked at Naomi's labs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(39,174,96);\">TSH: 2.3</span> - Perfect. Yes, perfect.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(39,174,96);\">T4: Normal range</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then I saw it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Her Reverse T3:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>20 TIMES THE NORMAL LIMIT</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>TWENTY TIMES.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The Lock and Key Analogy:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>- Your metabolism needs T3 (the key) to unlock energy and fat burning</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>- Your body makes T4, which should convert to T3</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>- But with hypothyroidism, it converts to REVERSE T3 instead</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>- Reverse T3 is a fake key that JAMS the locks</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>- Real T3 can't get in anymore</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>- Your metabolism completely shuts down</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The Cruel Irony:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"And here's what makes me angry,\" I continued.</p><p>\"Those extreme diets you've tried? They make it WORSE. Restriction creates stress. Stress creates MORE Reverse T3.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I could see hope flickering in her eyes for the first time.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqaZGTXA_2_text","label":"ggqaZGTXA_2_text","default":"<strong>The Protocol I Discovered That Should Be Standard Treatment</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5dSkQ3uSz_text","label":"gg5dSkQ3uSz_text","default":"<p>Naomi asked desperately: \"Then what supports the conversion? Do you know anything that might help?\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I went through all her bloodwork. She was deficient in nearly every mineral needed for thyroid conversion:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The Missing Pieces:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>- Selenium (200mcg):</strong> Forces the body to stop making Reverse T3</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>- Iodine (100mcg):</strong> But ONLY in a 2:1 ratio with selenium</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>- Zinc:</strong> Helps cells actually USE the T3</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>- Ashwagandha:</strong> Drops cortisol by 30% (cortisol triggers RT3)</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>- L-Tyrosine:</strong> Raw material for thyroid hormones</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>- Vitamin D3:</strong> Reduces conversion-blocking inflammation</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I had to find something with ALL these minerals. In one supplement. With the EXACT ratios that work together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I looked back at Naomi. So much hope in her eyes. I couldn't let her suffering go on.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyAmcwjUKZ_text","label":"ggyAmcwjUKZ_text","default":"<strong>What I Found in a Desperate Search to Save My Patient</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtHf36GAlh_text","label":"ggtHf36GAlh_text","default":"<p>I searched everywhere. Our prescriptions, medical databases – nothing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then I went where patients go when doctors fail them: Forums. Reddit. Support groups.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>On a hypothyroidism thread, buried beneath hundreds of women suffering like Naomi, I saw it:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The thread had started with one success story. By the time I finished reading, 200+ women had replied:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9kOq3vWn0_text","label":"gg9kOq3vWn0_text","default":"<p>I researched the formula. It had EVERYTHING. The exact 2:1 selenium-iodine ratio. Every supporting nutrient. Liquid form for absorption.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXk3JYZs3L_text","label":"ggXk3JYZs3L_text","default":"<p>SALE ENDS SOON</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_dayLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_dayLabel","default":"Days"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_hourLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_hourLabel","default":"hrs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_minuteLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_minuteLabel","default":"min"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_secondLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_secondLabel","default":"sec"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_weekLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_weekLabel","def